{"id":"H0051","lemma":"אֲבִישׁוּר","transliteration":"avishur","sayIt":"a-vi-SHUR","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Abishur","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 1Ch.2.28;\nson of: Shammai (H8060);\nbrother of: Nadab (H5070I); married to Abihail (H0032H);\nfather of: Ahban (H0257) and Molid (H4140)\n§ Abishur = \"my father is a wall\"\nson of Shammai, descendant of Judah","glosses":["abishur","abishur’s"],"count":2,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"1ch-2","v":28,"renderings":{"bsb":"and Abishur","kjv":"and Abishur"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-2","v":29,"renderings":{"bsb":"Abishur’s","kjv":"of Abishur"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"1 Chronicles 2:28","note":"The sons of Onam were Shammai and Jada. The sons of Shammai: Nadab and Abishur.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H0032","lemma":"אֲבִיחַ֫יִל","transliteration":"avihayil","gloss":"Abihail"},{"id":"H8060","lemma":"שַׁמַּי","transliteration":"shammay","gloss":"Shammai"},{"id":"H5070","lemma":"נָדָב","transliteration":"nadav","gloss":"Nadab"},{"id":"H0257","lemma":"אַחְבָן","transliteration":"achvan","gloss":"Ahban"},{"id":"H4140","lemma":"מוֹלִיד","transliteration":"molid","gloss":"Molid"}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}